/*
===============================================================================
 Name        : main.c
 Target      : LPC2478 + SST39VF3202C (x16) on EMC CS0
 Toolchain   : LPCXpresso / Redlib
 Description : SW2 -> ERASE sector at 0x8000_0000
               SW6 -> WRITE "akademika" to 0x8000_0000
               UART0 9600 8N1 prints first 64 words as 0xADDR = 0xDATA
               GLCD shows progress and a preview line.
===============================================================================
